# AMAROK ONE — Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env` at the repository root and adjust values for local development.

> **Never commit `.env` to Git.** All secrets use placeholders here.

# ── Database (PostgreSQL + Prisma) ───────────────────────────────
# Docker PostgreSQL uses port 5432; embedded fallback uses 5433 by default.
POSTGRES_PORT=5433
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://amarok:amarok@localhost:5433/amarok_one?schema=public

# Bootstrap: pnpm db:setup  |  Start API: pnpm dev:api

# ── API (apps/api) ───────────────────────────────────────────────
PORT=3000
HOST=0.0.0.0
NODE_ENV=development
CORS_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173

# Authentication (required for apps/api)
JWT_SECRET=change-me-use-a-long-random-string-min-32-chars
JWT_EXPIRES_IN=15m
JWT_REFRESH_SECRET=change-me-use-a-different-long-random-string-min-32-ch
JWT_REFRESH_EXPIRES_IN=7d

# Seed — default administrator credentials (local dev only)
SEED_ADMIN_PASSWORD=Admin@123456

# ── Web (apps/web — React + Vite) ─────────────────────────────────
# Vite exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to the browser (never put secrets here)
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3000

# ── Mobile (apps/mobile — Expo) ───────────────────────────────────
# Public API URL baked into iOS/Android release builds (EAS build env / secrets).
# Must be HTTPS for TestFlight devices (not localhost).
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3000

# ── Production ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# See .env.production.example for AWS / production deployment values.

# ── Optional: logging ───────────────────────────────────────────
LOG_LEVEL=debug

# Optional: protect GET /health/db in production (header X-Health-Token)
# HEALTH_DB_TOKEN=
